in their respective installed package directories. They include the official
MCP TypeScript SDK (Apache-2.0), Playwright (Apache-2.0), Express (MIT),
node-pty (MIT), Zod (MIT), and xterm.js and its fit addon (MIT). Browser-ready
xterm.js assets are copied without modification into public/vendor during
build, with their original license texts beside them. Chromium and its bundled third-party software
carry their own licenses in the downloaded browser distribution.

